1032
01:21:23.200 --> 01:21:24.580
I have a daughter.

1033
01:21:26.290 --> 01:21:28.040
And I'd do anything for her.

1034
01:21:28.620 --> 01:21:30.620
<span style="style.default_1">What the hell is he on about?</span>

1035
01:21:30.700 --> 01:21:32.580
