1036
01:21:33.250 --> 01:21:35.950
<span style="style.default_1">If I jump out of this window,</span>
<span style="style.default_1">I'll break my eggs.</span>

1037
01:21:36.040 --> 01:21:39.870
<span style="style.default_1">Because there's a truck down there,</span>
<span style="style.default_1">not of eggs but some damn rods.</span>

1038
01:21:47.910 --> 01:21:49.910
