I never lie!

1044
01:22:03.750 --> 01:22:07.580
Every child in Poland knows
that Tony never lies!

1045
01:22:07.660 --> 01:22:10.790
I'm telling you the truth!
I don't know where they are!

1046
01:22:12.290 --> 01:22:14.660
Lee, shut off your phone.

1047
01:22:17.120 --> 01:22:18.790
Sir, that's not my phone.

1048
01:22:27.950 --> 01:22:29.200
Teefa!

1049
01:22:29.700 --> 01:22:32.330
Don't try to act smart

1050
01:22:32.700 --> 01:22:34.660
Tell him to stay where he is,

1051
01:22:34.750 --> 01:22:36.580
and that you'll be there
in fifteen minutes.

1052
01:22:38.080 --> 01:22:41.950
<span style="style.default_1">-Tony, you son of a--</span>
