1055
01:22:46.250 --> 01:22:48.290
I'll be there in fifteen minutes!
Don't move, okay?

1056
01:22:48.370 --> 01:22:50.580
<span style="style.default_1">Yeah, okay.</span>
<span style="style.default_1">If you disappear this time, I'll--</span>

