1174
01:35:06.790 --> 01:35:09.370
<span style="style.default_1">You reside within my heart and soul</span>

1175
01:35:09.450 --> 01:35:11.950
<span style="style.default_1">Why won't you say something?</span>

1176
01:35:12.040 --> 01:35:16.790
<span style="style.default_1">Breathe life into me,</span>
<span style="style.default_1">So I can breathe</span>

1177
01:35:17.330 --> 01:35:22.500
<span style="style.default_1">I stand helpless</span>

1178
01:35:22.700 --> 01:35:27.910
<span style="style.default_1">Your soul is where I reside</span>

1179
01:35:28.000 --> 01:35:30.580
<span style="style.default_1">I can't bear anything else</span>

1180
01:35:30.660 --> 01:35:33.660
<span style="style.default_1">I can't live without you now</span>

1181
01:35:33.750 --> 01:35:38.250
<span style="style.default_1">Take me into the realm of your love</span>

1182
01:36:00.870 --> 01:36:05.830
